      "text": "Availability script\n\n    Request URL\n    https://qanty.com/p/appointments/list_day_schedule\n    Request Method\n    POST\n    Status Code\n    200 OK\n    Remote Address\n    199.36.158.100:443\n    Referrer Policy\n    strict-origin-when-cross-origin\nGuardar los JSON de la peticion y valida las condiciones de las\n3 reglas\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "zeNbh96fCttuC-nEs-2wu",
      "originalText": "Availability script\n\n    Request URL\n    https://qanty.com/p/appointments/list_day_schedule\n    Request Method\n    POST\n    Status Code\n    200 OK\n    Remote Address\n    199.36.158.100:443\n    Referrer Policy\n    strict-origin-when-cross-origin\nGuardar los JSON de la peticion y valida las condiciones de las 3 reglas\n",
